## 11. `sandbox/run` — the code sandbox directly

Run code without the agent loop. Hardened ephemeral Docker container: `--network none`,
`--cap-drop ALL`, `--read-only` rootfs, non-root, `/tmp` tmpfs `noexec`, memory/CPU/pids/time
limited. Languages: `python`, `node`, `bash`.

